{"articleNo":"70881","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=70881&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"대학원 지진파/저주파수 음파 신호처리와 응용을 위한 통계분석 교육과정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.11.30","hit":"5714","attachments":[{"name":"국문안내문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=70881&attachNo=2289"},{"name":"영문안내문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=70881&attachNo=2341"},{"name":"신청서(서식).pptx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=70881&attachNo=2367"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 419.54pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #e3f4e3; HEIGHT: 72.25pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">지진파/저주파수 음파 신호 처리와 응용을 위한 통계분석 교육과정 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(Statistical approaches for signal processing, application to seismic/infrasonic signals)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;한국지질자원연구원은 우리 국토 및 주변해역을 중심으로 국내외 지질조사 그리고 지질자원 탐사 및 연구를 수행하는 정부출연연구기관으로서, 국내외 지진학 관련 기술전문 인력양성을 위하여 지진파/저주파수 음파 신호처리와 응용을 위한 통계분석 교육과정을 실시하오니 관심 있는 대학원생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 -</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 과정명 : 지진파/저주파수 음파 신호처리와 응용을 위한 통계분석</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 일정 : 2012년 12월 10일 ~ 2013년 2월 20일</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(해당기간 중 10일간 지정일 교육)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 장소 : KIGM 국제지질자원인재개발센터 미리내룸(1층) 및 가람룸(1층)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 교육대상 : 국내외 관련기관 전문가(20명이내)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 수강료 : 200,000원(숙식비 별도)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 강사 : Dr. Maurice CHARBIT (Telecom ParisTech, 프랑스)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 신청기간 : 2012년 12월 6일(목) 접수마감</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">8. 신청방법 : E-mail/Fax 또는 Homepage(isgeo.kigam.re.kr) 접수</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">9. 문의 : 조경남, 김무늬 ☎ 042)868-3718,3713</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 자세한 사항은 붙임의 안내문을 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">* 첨부 1. 국문 안내문 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 영문 안내문 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 신청서(서식) 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 11.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">한국지질자원연구원장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
